              "id": 50,
              "attributes": {
                "description": "Once per Activation Sequence, if an allied model scores a Hit against an enemy within this model’s LoS, this model may perform an unmodified STK 1 Attack against that enemy (before DMG rolls). If there are multiple targets, choose one. This Skill is not an Activation or Reaction and does not consume AP. It ignores “(Ranged) Friendly Fire”. Hits generated from Chain Attack cannot generate further Chain Attacks.",
